printList [SimTalk]
Prints the contents of the list designated by <Path>, without the icon and information about origin and
class.
Remarks
The printout is identical with the printout you get when you click Print on the List ribbon tab.
The method applies to the objects DataStack, DataQueue, DataList, DataTable, and TimeSequence.
Type
Method
Syntax
<Path>.printList([string]) → boolean
Return Value
The return value has the data type boolean.
Example
MyDataQueue.printList
MyTimeSequence.printList
See also
Print List
