refillDialog [SimTalk]
Fills the open dialog box of a list or a table designated by <Path> with the current values.
Remarks
Updating the contents of the dialog box is especially helpful if you changed values via information flow
and you want to show these values in the list or table which you opened as a dialog box. If you did not
open the table as a dialog box, but as a regular list window, Plant Simulation will always show the current
values anyway. In this case the method recomputes any formulas contained in the list window.
Note
Values you changed in the dialog box but did not apply will be discarded.
Type
Method
Syntax
<Path>.refillDialog
Example
MyDataStack.refillDialog
MyDataQueue.refillDialog
MyDataList.refillDialog
MyDataTable.refillDialog
SimTalk
openDialogBox [SimTalk]
refillDialog [SimTalk]
Plant Simulation Help 11-3977
Unpublished work. © 2026 Siemens

